  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 501.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement the New Hampshire housing champion (HC) designation and grant program established pursuant to RSA 12-O:71 -75.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
